  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianKiss.CouchKissMarathon": "[pg]Gently, you decide to lay Arian down onto [arian eir] couch and get on top of [arian em]. The lizard puts [arian eir] hands against your cheeks, the adoring look in [arian eir] eyes revealing the warm feelings [arian ey] holds for you. The two of you begin to exchange countless kisses as you take Arian's hands into your own, interlocking your fingers together. The sounds of your smooching echo throughout the luxurious tent and go on for what feels like an eternity."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianKiss.DreamyLikeKissing": "[pg]When you finally stop kissing your lover, [arian ey] is left panting heavily with a dreamy look on [arian eir] face. Arian barely manages to say, [say: I... like... kissing.] You tenderly plant your lips onto Arian's one last time before getting up. [arian Ey]'ll probably need to rest for a little bit, so you leave Arian be for now."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianKiss.SurpriseKiss": "While visiting Arian, [arian ey] notices you staring at [arian em] and asks, [say: Is there something on my face, [name]?] Suddenly, you place a quick kiss on the wizard's lips, and [arian ey] blushes while stammering, [say: I... Oh my...] Arian hesitantly touches [arian eir] mouth, gradually getting over the sudden display of affection. [say: I didn't expect that...] Arian kisses you back, and then bashfully looks at the ground, before suggesting, [say: We could do this some more, if you'd like?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.BraveGirlWhisper": "[pg]You nod, though [Arian ey] can't see you from this position. You whisper that [Arian ey] is a very brave girl to face this kind of ordeal... and you can't deny that seeing [Arian eir] laying eggs like this has a certain appeal. [Arian Ey] looks very sexy. You tell [Arian em] that this is good practice for when [Arian ey]'s laying fertile eggs. You hope [Arian ey]'ll look as sexy as [Arian ey] looks now, once the time comes."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.BreakfastBelch": "[pg][say: Well, that's one way to look at it, I guess.] Arian laughs. [say: So, if you don't want to join me, a lady needs to have [Arian eir] breakfast,] [Arian ey] tells you, then swallows another egg whole, letting out a very unladylike belch. [say: Okay, that was a bit too much to swallow,] [Arian ey] admits, blood flushing the pale {0} of [Arian eir] face{1}."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.CatchFallingEggs": "[pg]Never stopping your ministrations, you ask what you should do? Arian doesn't have time to answer though, as you feel one of the egg shaped lumps beginning its journey down the lizan's birth canal. You feel [Arian eir] pussy dilating, far faster than it should on any woman, and for a moment you worry as the egg passes quickly, falling into your waiting hand. You barely have time to safely place it on the basin as another egg soon falls into your hand. Arian's belly vibrates with the rapid contractions, rapidly reducing in size as the eggs make their way out."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.CoughReminder": "[pg]You cough, trying to remind the hungry lizan before you, that you're still in the room..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.DeclineOfferDress": "[pg]You politely refuse, telling [Arian em] that [Arian ey] probably needs it more than you do, since [Arian ey] just went through labor. Anyways you should probably be going. You thank the lizan for the {0} egg and tell [Arian em] to enjoy [Arian eir]... meal... and point out that, while you personally appreciate the view, [Arian ey] should probably put on some clothes later."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.DevouringEggs": "[pg]Arian pays no attention to you, instead hungrily inspecting [Arian eir] just-laid egg. A trickle of drool oozes out of the corner of [Arian eir] mouth and is lapped up with a quick flick of a long tongue before [Arian ey] opens [Arian eir] jaws and crams the whole egg inside. [Arian Ey] mouths it around before [Arian ey] manages to puncture it, audibly sucking out the insides before spitting the crushed but still-intact eggshell out into [Arian eir] hand. [Arian Ey] grabs another and gobbles it down with the same eagerness as before, spitting out the shell after sucking out the contents."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.FemaleWord": "female"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.FetchWaterHelp": "[pg]Of course you can, you reply. You gently help [Arian em] down on the floor from [Arian eir] squat, and head towards the jug [Arian ey] indicated. Looking about, you quickly spot a mug and fill it with water, bringing the cool liquid back to the panting lizan. [Arian Ey] takes it from you and gulps down a sizable mouthful of it, then pours some over [Arian eir] head. [say: Ohhh... that feels better. Why don't you check the eggs, see if our little experiment worked? I'm just going to regain my strength,] [Arian ey] suggests."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.GaspsAndCovers": "[pg]Arian gasps and quickly covers [Arian em]self, smiling nervously to you. [say: Thank you for pointing that out, [name]. Although,] [Arian ey] giggles nervously. [say: If you'd rather I stay naked, I'm willing to do that for you...] You give the idea some thought... but decide to tell [Arian em] that you'd prefer [Arian ey] put on some clothes next time you visit. Otherwise you miss out on having [Arian em] sensuously strip for you, you laugh."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.GirlWord": "girl"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.HermPlaceholder": "herm{0}"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.HermWord": "herm"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.LungfulsAirHiss": " is sucking in great lungfuls of air, slowly hissing them out as [Arian ey] soldiers on through the contractions of [Arian eir] womb. So intent on [Arian eir] labors is [Arian ey] that [Arian ey] doesn't recognize your presence, at first. After a few moments, however, [Arian eir] eyes finally recognize you're there and [Arian ey] gives you a brave smile. [say: Ah, hello, [name]; sorry you had to catch me like this - I was hoping I'd have this over and done before you saw it,] [Arian ey] notes apologetically."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.NicerWithCompany": "[pg][say: Mmm... thank you, [name], that does feel nicer when it's someone else. This wouldn't be so bad if I knew it was going to be a baby at the end of it, but I go through all this for nothing more than a quick snack. I can kind of understand why harpies have always been so nuts about getting fertilized when they're full of eggs, now: it's not so much that they - or I - want to be moms so badly as it is just so annoying to go through this for absolutely no reward at the end of it,] the lizan notes, sighing heavily and leaning against you for support."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.PitchSwitchingLaugh": "[pg]The lizan laughs, a rather pitch-switching sound as [Arian eir] uterus continues flexing. [say: If you really think I'm sexy like this, [name], then I sure hope we'll end up doing this for real sooner rather than later. Oooh... not more left in me now,] [Arian ey] says, closing [Arian eir] eyes and continuing to push. As [Arian ey] said, within moments, [Arian eir] belly is flat as normal, while the last few eggs have clattered into the straw-lined basin [Arian ey]'s been squatting over. With a hissing sigh of relief, [Arian ey] gingerly straightens up and steps over it. [say: I... can you please get me some cool water, [name]? I have a jug over there?] [Arian ey] asks, pointing in the appropriate direction."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.PocketEggFarewell": "[pg]You laugh at Arian's reaction, telling [Arian em] that you don't mind. You should go right now. You turn to pocket the egg and leave Arian's tent, bidding the lizan farewell before you do.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.QuickFinishPromise": "[pg][say: Nnng... once it finally starts, it's over quick, so don't worry, [name]. I'll be done in a minute,] [Arian ey] promises you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.ScoldMissedCall": "[pg]You scold [Arian em], telling [Arian em] [Arian ey] should've called you when [Arian ey] was getting ready to lay; you would have gladly helped. You tighten the hug, bringing [Arian em] closer to your chest, one hand moving to meet hers as [Arian ey] slowly massages [Arian eir] belly. You entwine your fingers with hers and help [Arian em] massage [Arian eir] belly."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.SheepishEggOffer": "[pg]She pauses, just about to cram another egg into [Arian eir] mouth, and looks sheepish. [say: Ah... sorry, [name]. I'm just so hungry and, well, it's not like there's anything else in these things, right? Or did you want to try one?] [Arian ey] suddenly suggests, offering [Arian eir] latest 'treat' to you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.SortingEggsFind": "[pg]You nod your head, and begin sorting through the eggs. Most of them look like common eggs, not that much different from large chicken eggs. Eventually, you find one that seems to be appropriate. Separating this egg from the others, you check one more time and find out that Arian only managed to lay one {0} egg. Still, that's good enough for you. You take the egg and turn to place it gently on the nearby counter. When you turn to check up on Arian though you spot the lizan, casually lifting one of the [say: normal] eggs, sizing it up."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.SquattingBasinPose": " squatting over a wooden basin, one hand between [Arian eir] legs, massaging [Arian eir] dripping treasure, while the other is rubbing [Arian eir] belly to try and coax the eggs out of [Arian em]."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.SteadyHerSway": "[pg]You see [Arian em] sway momentarily, too focused on the task at hand to even notice you. Fearing [Arian ey] might lose [Arian eir] balance and fall, you quickly move behind [Arian em], hugging and steadying [Arian em]."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.TentLaborDiscovery": "As you approach the tent, you wonder if Arian's ready to lay those eggs... Your contemplations are promptly interrupted as you hear a pained moan coming from inside. Seems like Arian is in labor! Without delay, you rush inside, to be greeted by the sight of naked lizan-"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.ThankfulTakeOver": "[pg]Still, you are very thankful for [Arian em] doing this for you. Then you note that [Arian ey] seems to really have fallen into [Arian eir] role as a {0}. You would never expect to hear this kind of comment from someone who was a man before... but it's cute that Arian is acting this way, and you enjoy [Arian em] the way [Arian ey] is now. You give [Arian em] a peck on the cheek for emphasis. Now, [Arian ey] has a clutch to lay, and you'll be here during all the steps necessary to do so. You take [Arian eir] hand off [Arian eir] belly and place it against your midriff, then proceed to rub [Arian eir] belly by yourself. Your other hand, releases [Arian em] and does the same with the hand massaging [Arian eir] pussy lips, replacing [Arian eir] hand shortly as you tease and massage the contracting opening to [Arian eir] depths."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.TheLizanPrefix": "[pg]The lizan "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianLaysEggs.ThroatyMoanPraise": "[pg]The lizan moans throatily. [say: Mmm... you really do have magic fingers, don't you?] [Arian Ey] says, then winces. [say: Ahg, that was a nasty one - they'll be coming out any minute now,] [Arian ey] notes in a surprisingly level tone, moaning softly as [Arian eir] abdominal muscles flex and contract."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.AcademyMagesResearched": "[pg][say: And that's about it. There were mages researching this subject at the academy, but then the whole trouble with the demons happened... maybe someday we can resume our research in this area.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.AgreesAskTomorrow": "[pg]Maybe [Arian ey]'s right... you tell [Arian em] you'll ask [Arian em] to teach you more tomorrow and excuse yourself."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.AgreesWhereToBegin": "[pg]Arian nods. [say: Of course! Now where do I begin...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.AsksWhatChannelingIs": "[pg]Channeling? You ask."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.AwaitsYourQuestions": "[pg][say: And that is all; any questions?] Arian patiently awaits your reply. You sigh, tired after a long lesson on the fundamentals of magic and spellcasting. You tell Arian that you don't have any questions for now... but you'd like to repeat the lesson some other time."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.BackToCampSuffix": ", making your way back to camp."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.CampReturnSuffix": "make your way back to your camp."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.CombineBothArts": "[pg]As you walk, you ponder what you discussed with Arian and conclude that by combining conjuration with alteration, you could quickly and easily create an expanding conflagration of flames, burning your foes in combat."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ConversationInteresting": "[pg]You let Arian know that this conversation was very interesting; the knowledge [Arian ey] shared with you today is bound to be useful in your adventures."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.CouldAlterElements": "[pg]If you can conjure elements at will, would it be possible to also alter them? You could have one element start out as a non-volatile substance within your hands and then hurl it towards a target whilst also focusing upon changing its nature, thus creating an explosive reaction. For instance, you can start out with a small gathering of dust and quickly change it into a highly combustible element and make it look like as if you made the air explode."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.CuriousForExample": "[pg]Like what? You ask in curiosity."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.DontOverchargeConduit": "[pg][say: So remember: don't overcharge your conduit or the results could be disastrous... Just ask Boon,] Arian chuckles."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.EnchantingExplained": "[pg][say: Yes, the art of focusing your spell within a conduit - in short, enchanting objects.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ExactlyWhatHeMeans": "[pg]Arian nods pridefully. [say: Very well, [name]! That's exactly what I mean.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ExitTentBusinessSuffix": ", exiting [Arian eir] tent and going about your business."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ExitTentSuffix": "exit [Arian eir] tent."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.EyesAlightInterest": "[pg]Arian looks at you, eyes alight with interest at what you have to say. [say: Please, do share your thoughts.] You explain that if you are able to use magic to conjure elements, with a little concentration it might also be possible to alter these elements on the fly; you convey the method you theorized to the lizan mage."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.GladToBeUseful": "[pg]Arian grins happily at you. [say: I'm glad to be of use, [name]. Please come back soon; I would love to discuss more of it with you.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.InterestingSubject": "[pg]You smile and tell Arian this sounds like an interesting subject..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.LecturesOnConjuration": "[pg]You nod as Arian begins lecturing you on the finer points of the art of conjuration."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.LiftsClosedFist": "[pg]Arian lifts a closed fist. [say: Mind your eyes.] You nod. Arian points [Arian eir] fist towards a nearby wall and opens [Arian eir] hand. A bright flash of light shoots out of [Arian eir] hand to hit the wall harmlessly. [say: This was the element of light. I produced a bright light capable of temporarily blinding whomever happens to be looking at it when it's exposed.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ListensToLizan": "[pg]You listen attentively to the lizan..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.MagicBasisWillpower": "[pg][say: The basis of all magic is mental strength, or more appropriately, your willpower - the desire, the wish, the passion to make something that is not... be. Which is the reason mages study so hard to begin with.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.NewToMagicBasics": "[pg]You let Arian know you're actually pretty new to magic in general, so maybe [Arian ey] could teach you a few basics? Arian nods. [say: Very well...] Arian clears [Arian eir] throat."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.OffersToRepeat": "[pg]Arian smiles at you. [say: Of course, [name]. If you have any doubts or would like me to repeat, all you have to do is ask. I'll make sure to always have time for you.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PondersLessonApplying": "[pg]As you [walk] away, you start pondering Arian's lesson of the day. You wonder if you could perhaps apply the channeling principle to strengthen your [weapon] in combat."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PracticalExampleGiven": "[pg][say: Now to finish our lesson, I'll give you a practical example of how to effectively use conjuration to defend yourself. So pay attention, [name]. Conjured objects are generally weaker than real objects, so conjuring a shield or a suit of armor or even a weapon is no good. Not to mention it's quite complicated. A suit of armor is made not only of metal, but of other components as well - you'd have to conjure and maintain each individually. Instead, conjure a simple element that can turn the tide of the battle in your favor.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PracticeNewSpell": "[pg]You spend a few minutes learning how to properly use the spell, and after some practice you can reliably use the spell whenever you want to. You thank Arian for the lesson and for teaching you a new spell. Then bidding farewell to the grinning lizan, you leave, promising to visit [Arian em] again soon."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PraisesAlterationIdea": "[pg]Once you're done, Arian grins at you. [say: That's very good, [name]. Indeed, alteration is another art a mage must master in order to be considered a true master; let me give you a more detailed explanation...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PromiseReturnPrefix": "[pg]You thank Arian and promise to return sometime soon. You excuse yourself and "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.PutIntoPractice": "[pg]You should put that into practice sometime soon."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.QuiteComplexSubject": "[pg]Arian wasn't kidding; this is quite a complex subject..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.RaisesHandToStop": "[pg]Arian raises [Arian eir] hand, stopping you in your tracks. [say: I appreciate your enthusiasm, [name]. But first you must rest and let the lessons of the day sink in. I promise I'll teach you more tomorrow.] Arian smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.RatherThanBarrier": "[pg]You understand what Arian's talking about. [Arian Ey] means that rather than conjuring a barrier, it's best to conjure something akin to a bright light to try and blind your foe."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ReadyForAdvancedTopics": "[pg]You tell Arian you've got the fundamentals down, so why not cover something a bit more advanced?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ReadyToStartConjuring": "[pg]You say you have a pretty good understanding of how magic works now, so you'd like [Arian em] to get started on the more complex theories."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.RequestsMagicLesson": "You ask Arian if [Arian ey] wouldn't mind giving you some magic lessons."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ReturnToDutiesSuffix": "return to your duties."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ShareYourTheories": "[pg]You ask Arian if [Arian ey] wouldn't mind hearing some of your own theories about magic; you've been giving the subject a lot of thought lately."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.SuggestsChanneling": "[pg]Arian taps [Arian eir] chin in thought, then smiles. [say: I know! Let's talk about channeling.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.SuggestsConjuration": "[pg]Arian rubs [Arian eir] chin in thought. [say: Hmm... Aha! Let's discuss conjuration. This is where we start getting to the more complex theories and methods. I know I don't have to say it, but pay attention. Conjuration is an important art for any mage.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.TakesMentalNotes": "[pg]You pay attention to Arian's every word, making mental notes of the more important lessons..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ThankLessonPrefix": "[pg]You thank the lizan for the lesson and "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.ThanksAndFarewell": "[pg]You spend a few more minutes talking to Arian before thanking [Arian em] for the lesson and bidding farewell to the grinning lizan, you promise to visit [Arian em] again soon."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.TiredAfterLessonPrefix": "[pg]You wonder whatever could have happened that was so funny. But for the moment the lesson has tired you, so you thank Arian for the lesson and excuse yourself "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.TrekHomeSuffix": "begin the trek home."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.TryItSometime": "[pg]That would be very helpful; you'll have to try it sometime."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianMagicLessons.UsefulInCombat": "[pg]You note how such a spell could be useful for you in combat. Arian grins at you. [say: I'm glad this lesson was helpful, [name]. Come here and I'll teach you how to properly conjure it.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianNevermind.DeclineSeekExpert": "[pg]The offer is noted, but you won't take [arian em] up on that just yet. Perhaps, even, there is someone more knowledgeable about it. [say: I understand.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot4.AnythingForYou": "[pg]Arian smiles brightly at you. [say: No problem. I'd do anything for you.] [Arian Ey] gazes into your eyes in silence... perhaps a bit too long... You clear your throat and Arian seems to snap out of [Arian eir] trance. [say: Oh! Umm... is there something you want to do?] [Arian Ey] fidgets."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot4.ArianHasGoodNews": "Before you can say anything, Arian says, [say: Oh, I have good news, [name]!]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot4.AsksWhatNews": "[pg]Good news? What is it?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot4.CanChannelMagicThrough": "[pg][say: I'm feeling well enough that I think I can channel my magic through you and help you if you feel you're getting overwhelmed by this world's corruption. But due to the intensity of the treatment, I don't think I'd be able to do it more than once per day...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot4.UsefulDailyTrick": "[pg]You tell [Arian em] that, even if it's only once every 24 hours, that could be a very useful trick, and thank [Arian em] for being willing to make such a sacrifice on your behalf."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.AsksToLiveTogether": "[pg][say: I wanted to ask you if we could... well... live together?] Arian bites [Arian eir] lower lip."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.ExplainsPortalDuties": "[pg]You explain to Arian about the portal, and your mission as the champion - how due to your duties, you cannot just move here and live with [Arian em]."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.HeWouldMoveIn": "[pg]Arian quickly adds, [saystart]Oh... no... You wouldn't be moving here. I would be the one moving in with you..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.OthersAlreadyLiveThere": " There are other people living with you already, so what's one more? Right?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.PromptFinalDecision": "[pg]Well... when [Arian ey] puts it that way... what should you do?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.SayEnd": "[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.SpokeWithOthersAlready": "[pg][say: I've spoken with them already and I believe they are ready to pursue their magical studies on their own. They've been caring for me for a long time; I think it's time they lived their lives for themselves. Besides, we won't be separated for good; I'll come and visit every once in a while.] Arian smiles hopefully at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.WantsToAskSomething": "Before you can say anything, Arian stops you. [say: I've been meaning to ask you something, [name]. I've been feeling a lot better lately; in fact, I may be even better than I was before.] Arian blushes."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianPlot5.WeighsLivingRequest": "[pg]You ponder [Arian eir] request... On one hand, having someone who understands magic would be of great help for your quest, and you've come to enjoy Arian's company, but what about Boon and Laika?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.AlwaysEnoughStrength": "[pg]Arian smiles tenderly at you. [say: I always have enough strength for lovemaking, [name]. What do you feel like doing?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.ArianNervousAccepts": "[pg]Arian smiles nervously at you. [say: I... of course. I'd love to. What do you feel like doing?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.ArianWantsToLearn": "[pg]Arian smiles nervously and averts [Arian eir] eyes. [say: Of course. I want to learn more about you: your body, your thoughts, everything. So... what do you want to do?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.AskIfStrongEnough": "You ask Arian if [Arian ey] feels strong enough to do a little lovemaking."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.AsksIfJustThanks": "[pg]Arian smiles and averts [Arian eir] eyes. [say: I would love to. This isn't just thanks for my gift is it?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.AssureJustInMood": "[pg]You assure [Arian em] that's not the case; you just feel in the mood."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.NoNeedToAsk": "[pg]Arian smiles and strokes your [face]. [say: Do you even need to ask?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.OkayWhatDoing": "[pg]Arian looks at you happily. [say: Okay... what do you feel like doing?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexMenu.UndressWithLover": "[pg]You smile at your lizan lover and begin shedding your [armor]. Arian follows in suit, settling down on [Arian eir] bed and watching you enraptured as [Arian ey] awaits your decision. Once you're naked, much to the lizan's delight, you smile at [Arian em] and consider your options..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AdmitsItFeelsGood": "[pg]Arian blushes. [say: I... okay, I admit it... it feels pretty good... and is kinda kinky, too... Still, if you think I should be smaller... I wouldn't mind.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ArousedFemaleScent": "[pg]Arian sighs and flushes; the distinct smell of an aroused female begins to permeate the room. That and the lizan's cute fidgeting are a dead giveaway of [Arian eir] current state."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AskPreferredSexForm": "[pg]You look Arian over, and decide to ask what [Arian eir] preferred form of sex is."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksAboutEggs": "[pg]Eggs?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksAboutSexNow": "You smirk knowingly at [Arian em] and ask how [Arian ey] feels about sex now that [Arian ey]'s had [Arian eir] first time?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksAboveAllElse": "[pg]And above all else? You ask."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksHowHeFeels": "[pg]You tell [Arian em] that's understandable, and ask how [Arian ey]'s feeling about that."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksThinkingOfWhat": "[pg]Thinking?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AsksToUseHim": "[pg][Arian Ey] smiles nervously at you and begins fidgeting. [say: Perhaps... you'd like to... well... use me again? Please?] Arian asks hopefully."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.AvoidsTheTopic": "[pg]Arian bites [Arian eir] lower lip in embarrassment. [say: I... umm... can't we talk about something else?] You shake your head and tell [Arian em] there's nothing to be ashamed of. The two of you have already shared intimacy after all; and you'd like to know [Arian eir] kinks and wishes as well."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.BiggerThanHoped": "[pg][say: I'm certainly a lot bigger than I hoped to ever get. Sometimes it's a tight fit... in my slit I mean... but I kinda like it, and that also means it'll feel better for you if we... I mean... if you want to... Not that I mind, I'm happy just being with you. And if you want to change it somehow... I wouldn't mind.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.BoonLaikaWouldBerate": "[pg]As much as you'd like that, Boon and Laika, especially, are bound to berate you if they see you leaving [Arian eir] room with an egg in hand.[pg]Arian giggles, [say: That's true. Maybe we can find a way to be alone then?][pg]Maybe..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.CallsHimselfPervert": "[pg]Arian bites [Arian eir] lower lip and smiles nervously at you. [say: I guess that makes me a pervert for liking it?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.CantStopThinking": "[pg]Arian blushes and averts [Arian eir] eyes. [say: I can't stop thinking about when you use my ass... it feels really good... and if I had to say if there's anything I like... then it's that... I hope it feels good for you, too.] Arian smiles at you, nervously."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.CloseMakesHimHot": "[pg]Arian averts [Arian eir] eyes. [say: Just being close to you makes me... hot...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ConsiderItLater": "[pg]You tell [Arian em] you'll think about it."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.CouldChangeHisSize": "[pg]What about [Arian eir] size though? In this world it's quite easy to do something about that, if size is a problem."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.DoubleThePleasure": "[pg]You tell [Arian em] that it was no trouble; double the pleasure, double the fun, right?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.DoubleTheWork": "[pg]Although... that means [Arian ey]'d have double the work if [Arian ey] intends to masturbate. [say: Umm... why would you say that?] Arian asks nervously."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.EnjoysBeingUsed": "[pg]Arian blushes. [say: I'm... I like it when you use my ass... it feels really good,] Arian admits."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.FindsHimAdorable": "[pg]You smile right back at [Arian em]. You happen to find Arian is adorable, especially when [Arian ey] gets all shy like that. But if [Arian eir] lack of a matching dick is such a big problem, maybe you could find something in your journey to help [Arian em] remedy that. Would [Arian ey] like that?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.FineAsHeIs": "[pg]You ponder the idea, but decide that Arian is fine just the way [Arian ey] is; maybe someday though..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ForwardButWelcome": "[pg]That's... quite forward of [Arian em]... you didn't expect an admission like that. But you like it; [Arian eir] ass certainly feels good, and you're glad it is pleasurable and that Arian likes it so much."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.FreakishOneDick": "[pg][say: Well, lizans like me usually have two, and I only have one... I've always thought I was freakish and usually avoided any kind of sexual contact, not that it was hard to avoid it, since I usually had my {0} buried in a book. Maybe I wasn't as social because of that... or... I don't know. The point is, I never hoped to find someone who'd... you know...] Arian fidgets, smiling nervously at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.GlancesAtYourCrotch": "[pg]Arian takes a glance at your crotch."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.KeptItForYou": "[pg][say: It's a lot bigger than I'm comfortable with, to be honest. But you said you liked it, so I'm keeping it.] You see [Arian eir] robes beginning to tent, and can't help but tease the shy lizan. It seems that despite [Arian eir] complaints, [Arian ey] enjoys having a monster between [Arian eir] legs... one that [Arian ey] can't hope to hide."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.LizanEggLaying": "[pg][say: Yes, eggs. Lizan females lay eggs throughout their entire fertile period... I... have to deal with this monthly... and whenever the time to lay comes around I find myself thinking...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NeedsMorePractice": "[pg]Maybe [Arian ey]'s not sure yet because you haven't played with [Arian em] enough yet... Perhaps you should try doing more... stuff?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NervousLaugh": "[pg]Arian laughs nervously."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NervousNodAgreement": "[pg]Arian smiles nervously at you and slowly nods in agreement."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NoComplaintsAtAll": "[pg][say: Well, I don't have any complaints, personally. I feel good no matter what we do. Even if you don't touch me there. But if you want me to grow bigger, or maybe want me to get rid of it... I don't have any objections.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NoLongerWorries": "[pg][say: I had always resented my lack of a second dick,] Arian admits. [say: But I guess I don't have to worry about this anymore, thanks to you.] Arian smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.NothingSurprisesYou": "[pg]You chuckle. Maybe... considering the things you've seen in this world, you'd be hard pressed to find what kind of rule defines a pervert. But that doesn't matter; you enjoy using [Arian eir] ass too. Arian smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.OfferToHelpLay": "[pg]If that's the case, maybe you should help [Arian em] lay sometime."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.OnlyWithYou": "[pg]Arian averts [Arian eir] eyes. [say: I'm not saying I enjoy it... but I don't mind if it's you...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.PromiseToStopBy": "[pg]You tell [Arian em] you'll make sure to stop by when [Arian ey]'s close to laying then.[pg][say: I'll be waiting for you.] Arian smiles."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.RareToFindThis": "[pg]Oh, really? You ask. It's rare to find someone who actually enjoys anal sex, much less someone willing to admit it openly. This is something you certainly didn't expect from the shy lizan."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.RecallsAnalEncounter": "[pg]Arian rubs [Arian eir] chin in thought. [say: To be honest... ever since you... umm... put it back there...] Arian blushes. [say: I've been thinking that anal is not so bad... I was scared that it might hurt at first... and while it does hurt a bit, it also feels nice.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.RemembersCaughtHim": "[pg]You chuckle, and tell [Arian em] you haven't forgotten that time you caught [Arian em] masturbating."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ResentsOneDick": "[pg][say: I've always resented my lack of a second dick,] Arian admits."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SaysAboutYou": "[pg][say: About you.] Arian admits."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SheepishAgreement": "[pg]Arian blushes. [say: I guess...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ShrugsUndecided": "[pg]Arian rubs [Arian eir] chin in thought, but in the end [Arian ey] simply shrugs and says, [say: I guess I don't really have a preference... so I'm good with whatever you feel like doing.] Arian smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SighsAtNoBulge": "[pg]But sighs in disappointment when [Arian ey] sees no bulge. [say: Maybe... you could grow your dick back and... nevermind...] Arian averts [Arian eir] eyes."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SomethingCouldDoThat": "[pg][say: Oh... I suppose there might be something that can do that. Although I suppose it doesn't matter that much now. Unless you'd like me to get a second one?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.StrangeNewUrges": "[pg][say: I feel sick for no apparent reason. I have the strangest urges I didn't have. My chest feels heavy. And above all else...] Arian looks at you and blushes."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SurprisedAtPreference": "[pg]You're surprised to hear that. Not everyone enjoys anal sex."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.SurprisedPrompt": "[pg]Really?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.TakesDeepBreath": "[pg]Arian blushes, and takes a deep breath. [say: Okay...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.ThenTheEggs": "[pg]Reaaaally? You smirk at [Arian em]. Arian flushes even more. [say: T-there's also the eggs... so many eggs...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.TurningIntoGirl": "[pg]Arian sighs and licks [Arian eir] lips. [say: I never imagined I would ever turn into a girl... much less that I would know what being a girl is like... Everything feels different... but not in a bad way... just weird, I guess.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.WillThinkAboutIt": "[pg]You tell Arian you'll think about it..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSexingTalk.WouldLikeThat": "[pg][say: I think, I'd like that... sometime,] Arian replies."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.AcceptFeelEnergies": "[pg]You thank [Arian em] and accept the talisman, feeling the pulsating energies within for a few moments before placing it back around your neck. You thank Arian for [Arian eir] help, assuring [Arian em] that this will surely help you in your travels through these lands."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.AskPlaceInTalisman": "You tell Arian that you want [Arian em] to place the {0} in your talisman for you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.ExpectedThatRemark": "[pg]You can't resist noting you were expecting [Arian em] to say that, plucking it from your neck and passing it to the reptilian wizard."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.HandIngredientsPlease": "[pg][say: Okay. Please, hand me the ingredients and I'll have it imbued in a moment.] [Arian Ey] smiles at you. Fishing around amongst your belongings, you gather the necessary items and hold them out to the lizan."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.HumWaterGlows": "[pg]A soft hum emanates from within the bowl and the water begins glowing. It doesn't take long for the humming to fade; Arian reaches inside the bowl and lifts your talisman for you to see. [say: Here you go, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.ImbuedConfirmMessage": "[pg](<b>Your talisman has been imbued with the {0}. You can use it from the M. Specials menu in combat.</b>)[pg]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.NabsIngredientsDesk": "[pg]Arian eagerly nabs the offered ingredients and moves to [Arian eir] work desk. [Arian Ey] takes a nearby bowl and fills it with water, then looks around. [say: Hmm... I'm forgetting something... oh, right! I'm going to have to ask you for your talisman, too, [name].] [Arian Ey] extends a hand to you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianSpellPlace.TalismanInBowl": "[pg][say: Erm... right. Now I need to focus.] [Arian Ey] places your talisman in the bowl, submerging it in water, then closes [Arian eir] eyes and begins focusing [Arian eir] magic. Shortly after, the ingredients you offered suddenly burst into flames, burning until only their ashes are left; the ashes float into the bowl and mix with the water inside."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStory2DropIt.DropsTheSubject": "Though you do feel a little curious, you decide to stop making him uncomfortable, and tell him that it's okay, you'll let him get some sleep now."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStory2DropIt.TucksHimselfIn": "[pg][say: Thanks, [name]. I'll see you later then.] Arian tucks himself in. You watch until he's settled in, and then start the trek back to your home-away-from home in the Marethian wilderness."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.AdmitHeToldYou": "[pg]You nod your head and admit that he did indeed tell you that."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.ArianNodsShareStories": "[pg]Arian nods. [say: I guess it isn't fair that I'm the only one that gets to hear your stories... but before we start... How long ago do you think this whole demon trouble started?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.ArianRevealsHisAge": "[pg]Arian nods and smiles. [say: I'm actually 23 years old... So I can't tell you much about how this whole trouble started, I was only a child back then... and my parents made sure to keep me sheltered from all that as well...] Arian stares in the distance. [say: Sheltered, I guess that word defines me pretty well. I've been sheltered from the world for most of my life.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.AskAboutHisPast": "You feel like you'd like to know a bit more about Arian, so you ask if he would mind sharing some of [Arian eir] history with you. After all, as a survivor from at least the early days of the demon war, and a wizard to boot, he's got to have some stories up [Arian eir] voluminous sleeves."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.AskWhySpecialAttention": "[pg]You tell him that it's good to hear they got to know each other properly; is that why Arian gave particular attention to ensuring they escaped when [Arian eir] academy was attacked?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.AsksIfGuessRight": "[pg]Arian nods. [say: Good guess... And how old do I look?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.BooksOnlyLove": "[pg][say: Well, what I didn't tell you is that books used to be the only thing I cared about as well.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.CheerUpDepressedLizan": "[pg]You try to cheer the depressed lizan up, exhorting that he needs to be optimistic about things; after all, amongst all the crazy potions and tonics, surely there's something that can make a drinker healthier and stronger?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.EnjoyedTeachingStudents": "[pg]Did he enjoy having students of [Arian eir] own to teach?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.EnjoysYourCompany": "[pg]Arian smiles at your offer. [say: Well, that would certainly help. I enjoy your company; there's something about you that. Well... I guess you help me relax, and hearing about the world is not so bad either. But I really wanted to see it.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.EscapedTheAcademy": "[pg][say: Oh, yes. I got sidetracked, sorry.] Arian grins at you and says, [say: I escaped the academy.] You scratch the back of your neck; this isn't much of an explanation. Noticing the confusion in your face, Arian explains, [say: The academy didn't have any windows. Something about preserving our privacy and ensuring no external elements would interrupt our studies. It doesn't matter now. So, before escaping the academy with Boon and Laika in tow, I hadn't even gazed at the sky.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.EyesLightRecollection": "[pg]Arian's eyes light up in recollection. [say: Enjoy it? I loved it! These two... they became much more than mere pupils; they were my friends. I can even say they're part of my family. Having grown up alone, ignored by my elders, who were too busy with their next research project to pay any attention to me, and with nothing but books to keep me entertained. Can you imagine how many friends I had?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.FirmHandshakeDeal": "[pg]You give him a firm handshake, pronouncing that it's a deal. Arian smiles at you before opening [Arian eir] maw into a wide yawn. [say: Sorry about that, [name]. I guess I'm a bit sleepy...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.FrailFromShielding": "[pg]Does that have something to do why he's so frail now - the stress of shielding himself and [Arian eir] apprentices from the demons' black magic?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.GoingInsaneIndoors": "[pg]Arian sighs. [say: I know I shouldn't go out, but sometimes I feel like I'm going insane if I stay cooped up in here. I've spent so much time inside at the academy, and besides that, you have no obligation to help me at all. I couldn't trouble you by sending you to look after some kind of medicine I don't even know where to find.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.GuessLongTimeAgo": "you'd guess a long while ago given the general mess they seem to have made of the world."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.HelpIfHeBehaves": "[pg]All right, it's settled then. You tell Arian you're going to help him out, but he must promise to behave and stay in bed; if he keeps going out like when you first met him he's never going to get better."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.InsistHeRests": "[pg]And see it he will, but only if he listens to you and gives himself a real chance to recover! You insist that he start relaxing; it's probably the tension as well as the punishment he puts himself through in the name of boredom that's keeping him from making any major recovery."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.IntendedDefeatDemons": "[pg]Arian shakes [Arian eir] head. [say: Not exactly. It was my intention to defeat all of the invading demons; I was arrogant and it cost me greatly. I only managed to save Boon and Laika because they were the closest to me when the wave of dark magic hit us. I used much of my power and concentration to resist the wave's effects... it was brutal.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.MaraeSaidTheyAppeared": "Marae herself told you they showed up about, what, 20-30 years ago?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.NeverSawTheSky": "[pg]You blink in surprise; he'd never even seen the sky? How could they keep anyone so constrained? What - did he hatch indoors and was never allowed outside?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.NoncommittalShrug": "[pg]You shrug your shoulders; "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.OddBookwormWantsOut": "[pg]You comment that it does seem kind of odd that a self-professed bookworm would be so desperate to get out and stretch [Arian eir] legs, now that he mentions it. Arian laughs at that. [say: Yes, quite a change wouldn't you say?] Then, with a sigh, he says, [say: It's ironic actually. Since I couldn't go outside, all I had were the books; and the books had become my world: I read them, loved them, lived in them, and mastered them. With the time I spent reading, it was quite an easy path towards wizardhood. As soon as I was of age, I joined the academy formally, and during my testing I was shown to have skills greater than or on par with my testers. In the end, they didn't see a need to instruct me, so they declared me a master of the art and assigned me my pupils: Laika and Boon.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.ParentsKeptHimInside": "[pg]Arian sighs. [say: Well, I did tell you my parents kept me inside the academy at all times.] He sighs once again. [say: I never knew the world was so big, or so beautiful. I'd been missing out. I want to go out and see more. All the good and the bad.] Arian looks down. [say: But the truth is I can't, not like this.] He sighs in exasperation."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.PatHisShoulder": "[pg]You reach out a hand and pat him on the shoulder; you don't really think it'll make him feel any better, but it's what they always used to do when people got like this back in your village. As you pat [Arian eir] shoulder, you realize he still hasn't told you what made him change [Arian eir] attitude so much. Even as you continue giving him comforting touches, you ask why it bothers him being bedridden now if he was an antisocial stay-at-home bookworm before."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.PressForAnyRumor": "[pg]You press the subject and ask him if he really doesn't know or have heard about anything that could help at all."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.RecallsPossibleCure": "[pg]Arian furrows [Arian eir] brows in deep thought. [say: I think... I heard there might be something after all. Something... vitality... I don't recall its name right now. It's some kind of tonic or tea that is supposed to help you get tougher and stronger.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.SoundsQuiteLonely": "[pg]You must confess that the situation he's describing sounds quite lonely."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.SpellcastingTakesToll": "[pg][say: Yes, actually. I'm not going to get into any specifics right now, but my method of casting spells causes damage to the caster's body, which is why I'm in such a miserable state.] Arian sighs. [say: Now I can't even go for a walk...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.StudyReptilianWizard": "[pg]You look the reptilian wizard up and down, contemplating. Then you profess you aren't really familiar with people covered in scales, but you'd guess somewhere in [Arian eir] mid-20s?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.ThrilledTwoStudents": "[pg][say: So you can imagine how thrilled I was to get not one, but two people who would have to pay attention to every single instruction I gave them.] Arian looks down, a slight tinge of regret on [Arian eir] face. [say: I was pretty mean at first. I wound up taking my frustrations out on them, but thankfully they found it in their hearts to forgive me. We've been very close ever since.] Arian smiles."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.TriedManyCuresAlready": "[pg]Arian sighs. [say: I have tried so many already. Boon and Laika have been all over Tel'Adre trying to find something to help me get better, but nothing seems to work...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.TrustsYouAtLast": "[pg][say: Maybe you're right. All right then, I'll trust you [name]. I've been stuck inside the academy for many years... I guess I can hold out for a few weeks longer, as long as you come visit me.] He extends [Arian eir] hand. [say: Deal?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.UnderstandButMustRest": "[pg]You tell him that you understand how that must make him feel. Still, running around all the time clearly isn't doing him any good. Furthermore, it's no trouble at all; you want to help. Hmm... what if you promise to drop in now and then - share some of your stories about life in the wasteland, let him live vicariously through your actions? Will that encourage him to stay in bed and avoid overexerting himself?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.WhyParentsShelteredHim": "[pg]You ask why; what made [Arian eir] parents shelter him from the world outside?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.WishHimGoodSleep": "[pg]You smile, and tell him that it's all right and he needs [Arian eir] sleep, so he had best get into bed. Arian nods and tucks himself in. [say: Thank you, [name].] You bid him goodnight and gently close [Arian eir] door behind you. On your way out you let Boon and Laika know Arian is sleeping, then you make your way back to camp."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue1.WorldWasMess": "[pg]Arian looks back at you. [say: Well, the world was a mess, so they thought it best if I just stayed in the academy; they told me stories of young lizans walking outside who were dragged away by demons to take part in terrible rituals. They weren't entirely wrong I guess, but that was a really cruel thing to say to a child. Although, they were just looking after me, in the end, and as curious as I am... Well, let's not dwell on that.] Arian clears [Arian eir] throat. [say: So, I've been at the academy for as long as I can remember. I told you about how I used to live buried in books right?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.AsksAboutDreamLover": "[pg]You ask him why he feels like that - what's wrong with [Arian eir] dream lover? ...Is he worried because [Arian eir] lover is a boy? Or maybe a girl with a cock?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.BegsToForgetIt": "[pg]Arian swallows audibly. [say: No, that's not the point... I mean... maybe... just... just forget about it... I'm feeling a bit tired... Do you mind if we talk some other time?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.ConfusingDreamsLately": "[pg][say: I've been having... erm, confusing dreams lately.] Arian explains. Curious, you ask him what sorts of dreams; not bad ones, you hope."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.DreamStartsStanding": "[pg]Arian clears [Arian eir] throat and begins explaining, [say: First I'm standing somewhere - I don't know where - in Tel'Adre. I'm all alone, but I'm happy; I'm expecting someone. When the person I'm expecting arrives, we talk - I don't remember the subject now.] Arian fidgets."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.NotBadJustUnusual": "[pg]Arian quickly says, [say: No! Not bad ones! Just... unusual I'd say...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.NoticesHeLooksBetter": "You look Arian over, remarking that he seems to be getting better after all."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.QuestioningLook": "[pg]You look at him questioningly. [say: Maybe it's best if I tell you...]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.RealizesLustfulDream": "[pg]It doesn't take you long to figure out what kind of dreams he's been having. With a faint smile on your lips, you give him a comforting pat on the shoulder and tell him that there's nothing to worry about in having such dreams."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.ThanksThenSighs": "[pg][say: Thanks to you.] Arian smiles, then he looks down and sighs. You ask him what's wrong."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.UrgeHimToRemember": "[pg]You tell him he needs to try and remember what happened if he wants to really hear what you think, but so far it doesn't sound so strange."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ArianStoryDialogue2.WhatHappensLater": "[pg][say: You see, the strange part is... it's what happens later.] Arian blushes in embarrassment. [say: We go to my room and I... I'm sorry I can't talk about it!] Arian blushes even more."
