  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveIncubusDraftToArian.TweakExposedTip": "[pg]You can't resist reaching down and gently tweaking the exposed tip. Mmm... your little {0} is going to be a very naughty thing from now on, you tease, unless [Arian ey] intends to start wearing a loincloth?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveIncubusDraftToArian.TwoShaftsEmerge": "pair of shafts emerge from their hiding place. They throb and grow, settling in their"
