  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveIncubusDraftToArian.VoiceMoreMasculine": "[pg][say: I guess I'm male now?] Arian's voice sounds more masculine as well."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveIncubusDraftToArian.WhatYouThinkLeave": "[pg]You reply that is what you think. So, does [Arian ey] feel up to doing anything else, or should you leave him to get some rest?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveIncubusDraftToArian.WondersJoinBed": "[pg]A part of you wonders if maybe [Arian ey]'s hoping you'll join [Arian em] in bed, but then you take a closer look and concede that [Arian ey] is genuinely tired. You stroke [Arian em] affectionately on [Arian eir] {0}cheek and politely excuse yourself, heading back to camp."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveLethicite.AsksProvenance": "[pg]The mystic lizan pauses. [say: Lethicite?] [Arian ey] asks. [say: If that's what I think it is, I have to wonder how you got it.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveLethicite.DemonFoodWaste": "[pg]Acquisition aside, surely something can be done it with, one would think. It'd be frustrating to have obtained such a rare item only to find it's nothing more than demon-food."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveLethicite.OfferGem": "Pulling the pearlescent gem from your pouch, you offer it to Arian, expectantly."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GiveLethicite.SuggestsStaff": "[pg]Arian quickly begins to get excited. [say: Actually, yes! I scarce think there's anything more powerful for enchanting, at least for its size and simplicity.] [arian Ey] speaks with quite a bit of enthusiasm about the potential, and you can't say you're averse to some more enchanted gear. [say: Of course, I should be able to make something that works to great effect, but it'd be a waste to use it for something simple like binding a spell to a trinket. If you've an interest in casting magics that are more powerful by a significant margin, I would suggest enchanting a staff.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GoddamnitNoYouButtSlut.CantDoThatNow": "You apologize, but you really can't do that right now. Arian looks a bit disappointed, but smiles at you all the same. [say: Oh... okay. Next time then?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.GoddamnitNoYouButtSlut.QuietNod": "[pg]You nod."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ApproachHoodedFigure": "You approach the hooded figure with caution, asking if they're all right; it feels a little silly to say that, but you can't think of much else to say."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ArriveAbandonedPark": "[pg]It doesn't take long before you arrive at what looks like a small abandoned park; the grass has grown wild in some patches, while in others it is dry and withered. The lizan points at a nearby bench and you help him sit. With a sigh the lizan slumps back and closes his eyes with a smile."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.AskAboutTrouble": "[pg]You ask him if he's in some kind of trouble first. [say: No, of course not. My aides are just a tad overprotective, that's all,] he insists, coughing a bit."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.AuburnSlittedEyes": "[pg]Once it seems like he's calmed down, he looks at you and you gaze at his auburn slitted eyes. [say: Thank you very much.] He politely nods at you. [say: Would you mind helping me one more time though? I'm trying to avoid some people and I'd really appreciate it if you could help me go to a park nearby.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ConsiderOptionsDecide": "[pg]You consider your options, then decide it can't hurt to take him, conveying your decision to the sickly lizard-man."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.EvasiveHealthProblems": "[pg][say: Err, not really. I'm just going through some health problems right now...] He trails off. You wonder if maybe it has something to do with the whiteness of his scales - they look so abnormally pale - but leave the matter. Instead, you ask who he is and why he was in that alley where you found him."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ForgotIntroduction": "[pg]The lizan gasps and covers his mouth, startled. [say: Oh, forgive me. How rude, I should have introduced myself before.] He clears his throat and starts, [say: My name is Arian, and as you can see, I'm a lizan. I just wanted to go out for a little while, but my aides are intent on keeping me in bed; they say I'm not well enough to be going out... but I say if anyone knows my body, that would be me! And if I feel like going out, then so the gods help me, I will!] He finishes forcefully, before realizing he's rambling. [say: Oh, forgive me... this really isn't your problem, sorry for troubling you,] he says, letting his head hang."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.LeaveForNow": "[pg]You decide to leave him for the moment, and head back to the camp."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.MasculineVoicePlea": "[pg][say: Just... help me up,] a masculine voice asks, between coughs."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.NoticeCoughing": "[pg]Stay in bed? You noticed the coughing; has he caught some kind of sickness?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.OfferShoulderSupport": "[pg]You lean down and offer the stranger your shoulder, letting them place their arm across your neck before you stand upright, helping pull them to their feet. Once the hooded figure is standing, the hood slides off [Arian eir] head to reveal a {0}. His scales are white, almost absurdly so, and he takes deep breaths, trying to calm down his coughing fit."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ParkAddedToMenu": "[pg][b:(The park has been added to Tel'Adre's menu.)]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ReassureAboutAides": "[pg]You tell him it's all right. It sounds like he's been cooped up by his aides for a long time. [say: Yes, sometimes I just feel like getting a bit of fresh air, so I just come to this park.] He smiles to himself. [say: I shouldn't keep you though. Thank you for your help... err?] You tell the lizan your name. [say: I will be fine now, so I'll be seeing you.] He smiles at you in a friendly way."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HelpArianWhenYouMeetHim.ThanksForHelping": "[pg][say: Thank you very much for helping me get here. If I had to stay in bed even for a second longer, I swear I would have gone mad.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.EffectsStartQuickly": "[pg]It barely takes a second for the effects to start. As soon as he puts the bottle back inside the drawer, he collapses on the nearby chair. At first you consider calling for help, but any thought of doing so leaves your mind when you see Arian's shaft visibly shrinking, soon entering the recesses of his genital slit. As soon as his shaft disappears inside, his genital slit closes up, the skin connecting and leaving only smooth {0} on his groin; lower, between his -- or should it be her now? -- legs, another slit opens up, soon spreading open as a small erect clit emerges from the wet folds. Moisture leaks, wetting the wooden chair; the smell of aroused female fills the small bedroom and you feel your blood surging to your [cocks]."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.GetsUpExposed": "[pg]Arian gets up and off the bed, not minding that he's exposing himself completely; then slowly walks toward his work desk and opens a drawer. Reaching inside, he pulls out a mysterious bottle labeled with a pink egg. He turns to look at you as he uncorks the bottle and then downs its contents."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.GuysSometimesGirls": "You tell him that while you do like to play with guys once in a while, you prefer girls."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.HelpHerToBed": "[pg]You don't bother replying; you walk up to her and gently help her up. Then you push her gently towards the bed and begin stripping. Arian smiles and lays down."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.ImagineGirlLove": "[pg]You scratch your chin in thought, and imagine how he would look as a girl; then you tell him you'd love it if he was a girl. [say: Okay then... I... I'll do it!]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.NervousSmileAsks": "[pg]With a nervous smile, she asks, [say: S-So? How do I look now...?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.PrefersGirlQuestion": "[pg][say: So... you'd prefer if I was a girl... right?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.TransformationContinues": "[pg]The transformation is not over yet though; a throaty feminine moan precedes the appearance of a pair of small perky breasts, complete with sensitive little nipples. You watch in a daze as the transformation finishes, Arian's face growing softer, rounder, girlier; the same happens to her body, her hips grow larger, as does her butt, becoming fuller and attractive, giving her a beautiful, if slender, figure."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeFemaleArian.WondersHisPlan": "[pg]You raise your eyebrows in surprise. What is he planning on doing?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.HermsLikeMaleArian.FineWithGuy": "You tell him that's not the case for you; you don't have a problem with him being a guy. In fact, you think he looks very cute, earning you a nervous smile. Arian relaxes, letting you look over his body and decide what you want to do..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.AskPlaceSpellClause": "You tell Arian that, if it's not too much trouble, you'd like [Arian em] to "
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.ChangeExistingSpell": "change the spell in the talisman [Arian ey] created for you"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.ContemplateChoices": "[pg]You start observing the parchment, contemplating your choices. So, what spell will you have [Arian em] place in the talisman?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.DispellingSpellDesc": "[pg]<b>Dispelling Spell:</b> 1x White Book and 1x Black Book - Cancels all magical and alchemical effects currently affecting the PC, beneficial or not. (Does not cancel the effects of demon's lust aura.)"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.FetchesParchment": "[pg][say: Of course.] Arian goes to [Arian eir] work desk to fetch a small parchment and present it to you. [say: Here's all the spells I can Imbue your talisman with and the materials needed.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.HealingSpellDesc": "\n<b>Healing Spell:</b> 2x Slimy Cloth and 2x Vitality Tea - Heals the user, no chance for failure. More powerful than a standard healing spell."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.ImmolationSpellDesc": "\n<b>Immolation Spell:</b> 2x Goblin Ale and 1x Sweet Gossamer - Sets your opponent on fire, dealing damage over time."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.LustReductionSpellDesc": "\n<b>Lust Reduction Spell:</b> 2x Lust Draft and 1x Fuck Draft. - Reduces the PC's current lust, no chance for failure."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.PlaceNewSpell": "place a spell in the enchanted talisman [Arian ey] created for you"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.ImbueTalisman.ShieldingSpellDesc": "\n<b>Shielding Spell:</b> 2x Black Chitin and 1x Tough Silk - Increases defense for the duration of the battle."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianBegsNoLaika": "[pg][say: Please don't sic Laika on me!] Arian pleads."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianBringsOutBags": "[pg]Arian opens a small closet and brings out a pair of small bags. One of them is tightly closed and seems close to bursting, the other looks completely empty. Arian takes a few neatly folded spare sets of clothes and gently packs them inside [Arian eir] bag, then turns and walks to [Arian eir] work desk where [Arian ey] picks up a few more trinkets and bags them all."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianCallsForTwins": "[pg]Arian nods and tails you down the stairs towards the entryway. [say: Boon! Laika!] Arian calls. Within moments the twin ferrets present themselves, and upon seeing the bags in Arian's hands Boon smiles and Laika begins tearing up."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianConfirmsLeaving": "[pg][say: Of course I do!] Arian says enthusiastically."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianGrabsBothBags": "[pg]Having done that, Arian grabs both bags in [Arian eir] hands and happily announces, [say: All done!]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianHugsTheTwins": "[pg]Arian drops [Arian eir] bags and opens [Arian eir] arms, inviting the twins into a hug, which they happily accept."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianPacksToGo": "[pg][say: Great! I'll pack up and we can go right away!] Arian announces happily."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianProtestsNotBad": "[pg][say: Come on, I'm not that bad, am I?] Arian protests. Boon and Laika look at each other, then look at you, wearing expressions identical to your own. Finally you all nod in unison. Arian sighs..."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianPuzzledByJoke": "[pg]Arian looks at you in confusion. [say: Joke? What do you mean by joke?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ArianShrugsAtBags": "[pg]Arian looks at [Arian eir] bags and shrugs. [say: Everything I need is in here. I packed some stuff in advance, plus a few more clothes and some things I've been working on. It's really all I need, trust me.] Arian smiles."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.AskLizanLeaving": "You ask the lizan if [Arian ey] still really wants to leave [Arian eir] comfortable home in the city and come out to live with you in your little camp in the wastelands?"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.BoonBreaksHugFirst": "[pg]Boon is the first to break the hug, followed shortly by Laika. The twins then turn to you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.BoonHappyForYou": "[pg][say: I'm happy for you, {0}, I really am,] Boon says."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.DisbeliefAtSmallBag": "[pg][Arian Ey] can't seriously expect you to believe that's all [Arian ey] intends on taking."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.FarewellsThenHeadHome": "[pg]Having said your farewells, you begin the long trek back home... bringing with you a new ally (and lover) in tow."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.HermWord": "herm"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.LaikaFussesOverYou": "[pg][say: Make sure you're taking care of yourself, {0}. Don't forget to bathe regularly and eat well... and contact us once in awhile... and visit on the holidays,] Laika says, sniffing."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.LaikaThreatensScolding": "[pg][say: If {0}... I mean... if Arian gives you any trouble call us and we'll come running to give [Arian em] a good scolding,] Laika says with a bow."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.LaughAtHappyFamily": "[pg]You smile and laugh softly at the three; they really are just like family, aren't they? You promise that you'll take good care of their teacher and that you'll call them if [Arian ey] needs them to spank [Arian em]."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.ManWord": "man"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.PupilsNowFullMages": "[pg]Arian smiles at [Arian eir] pupils. [say: I'm not your {0} anymore. From now on you're full-fledged mages. Remember all that you learned, and I'm sure you'll be okay.]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.SighAndResign": "[pg]You sigh softly, and resign yourself to having to come back and fetch the stuff [Arian ey] forgot in a day or so. You tell [Arian em] to say goodbye to [Arian eir] apprentices; you're leaving now."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.SkepticalAboutBags": "[pg]You look at the bags skeptically and ask what kind of joke the lizan is trying to pull over you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.TwinsAskTakeCare": "[pg][say: Please, [name], take good care of the {0}... err... Arian. [Arian Ey] might be a handful sometimes, but [Arian ey]'s a really good person,] Boon says with a bow."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.WomanWord": "woman"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.InviteArianToCamp.YouAgreeReluctantly": "[pg]Well, if [Arian ey] really wants to do that... though why [Arian ey] would want to do that escapes you... [Arian ey] can come and move in. But [Arian ey] will need to bring [Arian eir] own tent and sleeping bag and stuff like that, you warn the overenthusiastic lizard-"
