  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.ArianHappyInvite": "[pg][say: [name], is that you? Come in!] You hear Arian happily say. You open the door and step in to find Arian sitting by [Arian eir] table, a book is laying on the table and a mug of tea in [Arian eir] hand. [Arian Ey] motions to a chair nearby as [Arian ey] sips [Arian eir] tea. [say: Pull up a chair. May I offer you some tea?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.ArianStayedInside": "[pg]You head inside at the ferret's gesture, wondering if Arian has stayed or not. To your pleasant surprise, he is seated inside his bed, tucked somewhat sulkily under the covers. You tell him that you wanted to come and visit, apologizing if you're interrupting something important."
