  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.AskIfBigDeal": "[pg]You ask if that's really such a big deal; all he wanted was to go and sit in a park. Laika points an accusing finger at you and is about to say something when a masculine voice interrupts her. [say: Sis! What's the problem?] Slowly, another {0} emerges from the hallway nearby, clad in robes much like his sister's. If Laika were to remove her spectacles, they would look like identical twins."
