  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.BoonEscortsOut": "[pg][say: Boon, would you please escort [name] out?] Boon nods and smiles. [say: Of course, master. Please come with me, [name].] You say one last farewell to the smiling lizan and start on your way out of the house. Once at the doorsteps, Boon stops you. [say: Hey, [name]. You're an adventurer right?]"
  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.BoonLeadsUpstairs": "[pg]Boon smiles and motions for you to follow, leading you upstairs. [say: You see... master Arian didn't always enjoy taking long walks... I don't really know what made him suddenly take a liking for long walks around the city, but his condition does not allow him to do so, and he's just too stubborn to admit it. So we kinda have to reel him in, or he will end up passing out in one of the rough parts of the city.] Boon explains, turning on a hallway. [say: Still, master looked really happy when he came back. I'm glad he wound up meeting someone nice like you, instead of a mugger or a thief.] Boon smiles at you."
  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.BoonStopsLaika": "[pg][say: Boon, this is the...] Boon raises his hands, stopping Laika mid-sentence. [say: Yes, sister. Half the neighborhood knows by now.] He walks up to his sister and slowly pushes her back towards the kitchen. [say: Let me handle this, sis. Just finish doing the dishes and cool your head down, I've already finished with my chores, so I can attend to our visitor.]"
