  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.DrawerNoiseInvite": "[pg]You hear the sound of drawers being pulled open and forcefully closed. [say: C-come in!] You hear Arian announce. Curious as to what [Arian ey]'s up to, you open the door and step inside to see Arian sitting on [Arian eir] work desk. [Arian Ey] slowly turns on [Arian eir] swivel chair to gaze at you with a smile. [say: Hello, [name]!] [Arian Ey] motions to a nearby chair. [say: I was just working on a little project, nothing important. So, make yourself at home!] [Arian Ey] smiles happily at you."
