  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.ExtraMedicineAfterPark": "[pg][say: Well, I had to take some extra medicine after that little stunt at the park. But that aside, I've been well.] Arian smiles. [say: What about you, my friend? How have you been? Have you done anything interesting between now and our last meeting? I don't get to go out much, so I'd love to hear about whatever you can tell me about the world outside.] Arian awaits your reply expectantly."
