  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.GlaresThenComplies": "[pg]Laika glares at both you and her brother, but complies. Sighing, Boon turns to you. [say: Hello, [name]. I'm Boon, Laika's brother and master Arian's apprentice. You'll have to forgive my sister, she's rather... passionate... when it comes to our master, but she does have a point. What if master Arian had collapsed? Or needed his medicine?]"
