  "Scenes.Arianscene.VisitAriansHouse.ListensLikeChild": "[pg]Arian listens attentively, like a child being told a story. When you're done Arian smiles at you. [say: Wow, you must be really busy. And you still found time to be with a sickly mage. Thank you so much for coming; it really means a lot to me.] Arian takes your hand between his. Despite yourself, you feel a swell of pride at the attention he's showing you; you squeeze his hand gently and promise him that you'll make sure and come back again if he's always going to be this attentive a listener. It's nice to hear people are interested in your stories."
